The '''Shifted Tavern''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Wyld Woods}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the [[Wilderness#Tavern|Tavern]].

== Features ==
The '''Shifted Tavern''' features a few attractions.

=== Customers ===
The '''Shifted Tavern''' is full of tables, with various [[NPCs]] sitting at them. The player cannot talk to them, and the NPCs will not grant dialogue unless having purchased a tip to obtain the [[Stability Elixir]]. The NPCs converse with one another through holograms. The paid tips lead from [[Shifted]] to a bunch of other NPCs and then to [[Fafnir]], who is the last NPC of the chain. After speaking to [[Fafnir]], the player is able to obtain a [[Stability Elixir]] from the [[Argofay Serialbather]]. The [[Argofay Serialbather]] will not be of any use unless the player finishes speaking with all the NPCs.

=== Shifted ===
{{Main|Shifted}}
[[Shifted]] is an [[NPC]] and the main feature of the '''Shifted Tavern'''. They are a reference to [[Shifty]], and own the '''Shifted Tavern'''. The player can interact with them to open their shop, where they can purchase various elixirs for [[Motes]]. [[Shifted]] will also converse with [[Dackinoru]] through holograms.

